WEBVTT

00:01:29.413 --> 00:01:31.996
that was ravaged by settler colonialism.

00:01:33.079 --> 00:01:35.454
My grandma and both of her parents

00:01:35.496 --> 00:01:39.204
survived the trauma and abuse
of the Indian boarding school system.

00:01:40.246 --> 00:01:41.954
The generation before them

00:01:41.996 --> 00:01:44.163
fought to keep our tribe
from being terminated

00:01:44.163 --> 00:01:45.996
by the federal government.

00:01:47.038 --> 00:01:48.538
Going even further back,

00:01:48.579 --> 00:01:51.121
my six times great grandfather's signature

00:01:51.163 --> 00:01:54.788
is on the 1863 Treaty of Old Crossing,

00:01:54.829 --> 00:01:59.954
which forced the Anishinaabe to give up
11 million acres of what’s now Minnesota

00:01:59.996 --> 00:02:03.288
in exchange for a little
over 400,000 dollars